763
00:39:54,309 --> 00:39:56,727
- Coincidences are rare.
- [John] When I saw your military record,

764
00:39:56,728 --> 00:39:58,854
I told those federal boys

765
00:39:58,855 --> 00:40:01,315
that you'd be a hard man to scare away.

766
00:40:01,316 --> 00:40:04,985
And I'll be damned if you aren't
out there running circles around 'em.

767
00:40:04,986 --> 00:40:06,987
He's already found out
more than they have.

768
00:40:06,988 --> 00:40:08,114
Who are they?

769
00:40:08,115 --> 00:40:09,532
I can't say.

770
00:40:09,533 --> 00:40:10,950
Why is the CIA involved?

771
00:40:10,951 --> 00:40:12,952
Don't know.
I got nothing to do with the CIA.

772
00:40:12,953 --> 00:40:14,328
Would you tell me if you did?

773
00:40:14,329 --> 00:40:16,080
Probably not.

774
00:40:16,081 --> 00:40:19,334
But I wouldn't pretend not to know,
'cause I don't have time for bullshit.

775
00:40:20,252 --> 00:40:21,628
Did you know Anna Merrick?

776
00:40:22,712 --> 00:40:24,880
Never heard of her
before early yesterday morning,

777
00:40:24,881 --> 00:40:27,842
when I got a courtesy call from those feds

778
00:40:27,843 --> 00:40:30,929
who told me that she might be involved
in a minor data breach.

779
00:40:32,013 --> 00:40:34,223
Did she really say my husband's name
before she died,

780
00:40:34,224 --> 00:40:37,768
or did you get it from the CIA
like you told the investigators?

781
00:40:37,769 --> 00:40:39,145
Neither.

782
00:40:39,146 --> 00:40:40,229
Then you're a liar.

783
00:40:40,230 --> 00:40:41,814
Sometimes.

784
00:40:41,815 --> 00:40:44,275
Well, who did you hear my name from?

785
00:40:44,276 --> 00:40:46,777
From someone who said
the data Anna Merrick took

786
00:40:46,778 --> 00:40:48,362
was connected
to a Delta mission you were on

787
00:40:48,363 --> 00:40:50,197
in Indonesia back in the '90s.

788
00:40:50,198 --> 00:40:53,033
Anna Merrick worked
for Human Resources Command.

789
00:40:53,034 --> 00:40:55,244
Specific Delta mission information

790
00:40:55,245 --> 00:40:57,746
is locked away where an HRC file clerk

791
00:40:57,747 --> 00:40:59,957
couldn't get to it even if she wanted to.

792
00:40:59,958 --> 00:41:02,376
Anna Merrick couldn't have had access
to anything more than

793
00:41:02,377 --> 00:41:05,588
general details.
Dates and units and such.

794
00:41:05,589 --> 00:41:07,756
The person who gave me your name
wouldn't need more than that

795
00:41:07,757 --> 00:41:09,216
to prove what she's trying to prove.

796
00:41:09,217 --> 00:41:10,802
Which is?

797
00:41:14,931 --> 00:41:17,183
Something of a delicate nature.

798
00:41:17,184 --> 00:41:19,977
My wife's tougher than you and me
covered in cowhide.

799
00:41:19,978 --> 00:41:21,897
So, whatever you got, say it.

800
00:41:23,440 --> 00:41:26,025
Dates and units are more than enough
to prove that you were in-country

801
00:41:26,026 --> 00:41:27,943
when my source was conceived.

802
00:41:27,944 --> 00:41:31,155
That's what this is about?
You think I had an affair?

803
00:41:31,156 --> 00:41:34,116
That there's some love child out there
looking for Daddy?

804
00:41:34,117 --> 00:41:36,076
[short chuckle]

805
00:41:36,077 --> 00:41:38,245
Well, I can absolutely assure you

806
00:41:38,246 --> 00:41:39,830
that when I was in-country,

807
00:41:39,831 --> 00:41:42,499
my powder wasn't
the only thing I kept dry.

808
00:41:42,500 --> 00:41:46,128
Hell, if my DNA is all it's gonna take

809
00:41:46,129 --> 00:41:47,631
to get you to leave us alone...

810
00:41:49,883 --> 00:41:52,176
Here you go. Run the test.

811
00:41:52,177 --> 00:41:55,263
You'll see that I did not
father any children in Indonesia.

812
00:41:57,140 --> 00:41:58,642
That won't be necessary.

813
00:41:59,768 --> 00:42:01,269
I believe you.

814
00:42:03,939 --> 00:42:06,649
You just had to come and look me
in the eye and ask me the question.

815
00:42:06,650 --> 00:42:08,943
But you had already begun to suspect that

816
00:42:08,944 --> 00:42:10,820
there was more to this
than what you've been told.

817
00:42:12,322 --> 00:42:16,033
I can't see the CIA being so involved
in a domestic political sex scandal

818
00:42:16,034 --> 00:42:18,953
that they'd kidnap
three American citizens on U.S. soil.

819
00:42:18,954 --> 00:42:20,455
Two of 'em cops.

820
00:42:21,748 --> 00:42:23,166
Me neither.

821
00:42:24,334 --> 00:42:27,337
We've elected presidents
after sex scandals.

822
00:42:28,421 --> 00:42:31,215
People don't seem to care much
about that anymore.

823
00:42:31,216 --> 00:42:33,259
CIA seems to care.

824
00:42:33,260 --> 00:42:35,052
Well...

825
00:42:35,053 --> 00:42:37,055
their involvement troubles me, too.

826
00:42:38,556 --> 00:42:41,309
My friends who wouldn't
show you their IDs are looking into that.

827
00:42:42,894 --> 00:42:44,770
Of course, you understand
that I can't give you

828
00:42:44,771 --> 00:42:47,106
any details of my Delta missions,

829
00:42:47,107 --> 00:42:49,400
but what I can assure you
is that no crimes

830
00:42:49,401 --> 00:42:51,068
were committed by me or any of my men.

831
00:42:51,069 --> 00:42:54,238
My husband's been
in the political spotlight long enough

832
00:42:54,239 --> 00:42:56,323
that if there was anything to find,

833
00:42:56,324 --> 00:42:58,993
some muckraker would've found it by now.

834
00:42:58,994 --> 00:43:01,704
Be that as it may, Mrs. Sampson,

835
00:43:01,705 --> 00:43:04,039
Anna Merrick didn't kill herself
over nothing.

836
00:43:04,040 --> 00:43:05,541
No one ever does.

837
00:43:05,542 --> 00:43:07,126
[solemn music playing]

838
00:43:07,127 --> 00:43:08,837
But it was nothing to do with me.

839
00:43:09,921 --> 00:43:12,047
I suggest

840
00:43:12,048 --> 00:43:13,966
you stand down,

841
00:43:13,967 --> 00:43:15,260
let the authorities handle it.

842
00:43:16,553 --> 00:43:17,803
I can't do that.

843
00:43:17,804 --> 00:43:19,596
Why not just walk away?

844
00:43:19,597 --> 00:43:22,350
Lots of people have been
asking me that lately.

845
00:43:23,852 --> 00:43:25,311
I have my reasons.

846
00:43:25,312 --> 00:43:27,563
Well, suit yourself.

847
00:43:27,564 --> 00:43:29,606
Bottom line:

848
00:43:29,607 --> 00:43:31,860
we are as in the dark
on this thing as you are.

849
00:43:34,779 --> 00:43:36,947
Okay. [clears throat]

850
00:43:36,948 --> 00:43:38,615
For what it's worth, Reacher,

851
00:43:38,616 --> 00:43:40,534
we hope the Merrick boy turns up safe

852
00:43:40,535 --> 00:43:42,578
and we're truly saddened
to hear that his mother

853
00:43:42,579 --> 00:43:44,164
felt compelled to take her own life.

854
00:43:45,373 --> 00:43:47,041
But there's nothing more we can do.

855
00:43:47,042 --> 00:43:49,168
And we need to get to Baltimore.

856
00:43:49,169 --> 00:43:52,297
Fundraiser, first thing in the morning,
and it's late, so if you'll excuse us.

857
00:43:54,507 --> 00:43:56,009
Ma'am.

858
00:43:59,262 --> 00:44:01,347
[door opens]

859
00:44:01,348 --> 00:44:02,849
[door closes]

860
00:44:07,228 --> 00:44:09,605
Hey. How'd it go?

861
00:44:09,606 --> 00:44:11,607
I don't believe Sampson's behind this.

862
00:44:11,608 --> 00:44:12,608
Then who?

863
00:44:12,609 --> 00:44:14,611
[reporters clamoring]

864
00:44:24,913 --> 00:44:26,789
We need to have a private conversation...

865
00:44:26,790 --> 00:44:27,957
[continues indistinctly]

866
00:44:29,376 --> 00:44:31,418
Hey, who's that guy talking to Sampson?

867
00:44:31,419 --> 00:44:33,712
That's Nolan Cahill.
Sampson's chief of staff.

868
00:44:33,713 --> 00:44:35,131
[Tamara] What's wrong?

869
00:44:36,674 --> 00:44:38,675
Remember when I said
there was a fourth witness on the train

870
00:44:38,676 --> 00:44:39,968
